<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sabratek downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sabratek downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>-- Jefferies &amp; Co Inc downgraded Sabratek Corp to ACCUMULATE from buy after the stock closed just above the brokerage firm's $28 price target.</p>
<p>-- Sabratek up 3/4 to 29-1/2.</p>
</text>
